{"4974810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dark Are The Crypts: The Lost Idea", "steam_appid": 4974810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Dark Are The Crypts</strong> is an existential psychological horror set within the decaying mind of a tormented artist.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Find The Lost Idea</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your main goal is to find <strong>The Lost Idea</strong> - a creation belonging to a mysterious spirit who offers you its help in return. Follow the path it reveals and discover where this journey will lead you.<br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4974810/extras/5a7ba6b1c63ad11eb7c9a1f4e49efded.poster.avif?t=1787247379\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4974810/extras/5a7ba6b1c63ad11eb7c9a1f4e49efded.webm?t=1787247379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4974810/extras/5a7ba6b1c63ad11eb7c9a1f4e49efded.mp4?t=1787247379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Use a Camera</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This surreal world hides countless secrets and dangers. With your camera, you can reveal what cannot be seen with the naked eye. Use it to uncover hidden truths, solve environmental puzzles, and defend yourself against the horrors lurking in the darkest corners of your mind. <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4974810/extras/78c90e9853f392d3068ae724a4bc6c3d.poster.avif?t=1787247379\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4974810/extras/78c90e9853f392d3068ae724a4bc6c3d.webm?t=1787247379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4974810/extras/78c90e9853f392d3068ae724a4bc6c3d.mp4?t=1787247379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore Surreal Spaces</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Traverse endless corridors and abstract megastructures shaped by a fractured consciousness. Discover hidden notes, magazine pages, and forgotten fragments of thought. Explore the structure of the artist's mind and uncover the secrets hidden deep within the crypts.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4974810/extras/122b34b902d5d77b36864be237c6c94f.poster.avif?t=1787247379\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4974810/extras/122b34b902d5d77b36864be237c6c94f.webm?t=1787247379\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4974810/extras/122b34b902d5d77b36864be237c6c94f.mp4?t=1787247379\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Dark Are The Crypts</strong> is an existential psychological horror set within the decaying mind of a tormented artist.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Find The Lost Idea</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your main goal is to find <strong>The Lost Idea</strong> - a creation belonging to 